// The walker example: a stick figure walks across the window and back, a
// picture of the resources folder for each step of its walk. Its target is
// the web, in C#: the window lives on the server, where the timer's handler
// moves the figure, and Clarity.UI draws it in the browser. The modules are
// in the walker folder next to this file.
project Walker
    title "Walker"
    stack csharp web
    output "out"
    language "en"
    theme Light Dark
    datasource main sqlite "data/walker.db"
